    ‖ratComplexValue (lowZeroCoefficientsP1J3I4K2State 0)-
      complexPowerExpAtom (complexThetaExponent lowZeroSeedP1J3I4K2Point)
        (Real.pi*(2:ℝ)^2) (((25:ℚ)/2):ℂ)‖≤
      (lowZeroSeedRadius (lowZeroCoefficientsP1J3I4K2State 0):ℝ) := by
  rw [lowZeroCoefficientsP1J3I4K2_seed_eq]
  have he := lowZeroSeedP1J3I4K2_actual_atom_error
